  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃……『W.I.N.G.』の二次審査の結果が出た\r\n残念だけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040010,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そう、ですか……アイドルってやっぱり厳しいですね……\r\n私の力はまだまだ足りてないんだってよくわかりました……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040020,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私、自分がアイドルに向いてるのか、\r\nまだよくわかっていません……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040030,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、ちょっとずつ歌やダンスが上手くなって、\r\nいろんなお仕事も頂いて……毎日が楽しく思えてきたんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040040,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "アイドルとしてやっていけるのか、\r\nそれほど自信はありません。けど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040050,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "まだ、アイドルを続けていきたいですっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040060,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから……プロデューサーさんさえ良ければ……\r\nこれからも私のこと応援してくれませんか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ、真乃！　\r\nこちちこそ、これからもよろしく頼むよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim2": "blank"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001040070,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……ありがとうございますっ\r\n私、頑張りますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100104/7001001040070"
  },
